WEBVTT

NOTE English translation; original display timings, not word alignment.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.133
This image starts with a pose.

2
00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.533
In ArtCraft,

3
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.467
raise an arm, bend a leg,
and get the pose right.

4
00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.600
Then add a prompt:
"A metal robot on Mars."

5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.067
The model uses the pose and text
as references to generate the image.

6
00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:15.933
The editor is open source.

7
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:18.733
The models you connect
may charge separately.

8
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.133
Want to create your own character?
Take a look.

9
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:24.500
The ArtCraft repository link
is in the comments.
